  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Sector Programme Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective for Danish support is to create a higher level of income for the rural population. 
The second phase of the programme focuses on legislative reform and overall political and economic conditions for development and commercialisation of the agricultural sector along with increased focus on the private sector.  The programme has four components 1) Policy and reform related to the agricultural sector, 2) Private sector development in agriculture, 3) Production of seed corn at village level, 4) District based agricultural development.</narrative>
  </description>
